the shopkeepers favor an open door policy and, as usual, shoplifting is
considered a major offense punishable by death (enforced by Keystone Kops).
killing a shopkeeper angers the others who will seek you and repay the favor.
the idea is to look around when you first encounter the mall and then to
come back later and spend the excess gold you'll eventually have.

